64485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-30T22:41:51Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T14:04:36Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Nobara Linux 43 (Workstation Edition) on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Laptop GPU - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 9 185H (22 threads) - 62.40 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nA `@tool` script with `_set` cannot be removed by either the clear context menu or the revert button next to the script selection in the inspector.\n\nThis is problematic because as a beginner, you might only add scripts using that inspector and then be confused why you can't remove them, since the detach button is in the extreme opposite of the workspace.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen attached project. Try to remove the WallCollisions script from the root node in Tile using the clear or revert buttons.\n\n### Workarounds\n\n1. Remove the _set function.\n2. Use the detach button.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[area3dtest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23842558/area3dtest.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113377/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}